#: scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 256c9c2fc0a1114f50960b69a4daf3cac596a3e2ef482ed791e2b3a7f71bb5d9
#. default-sha256: 3ff44dcaa068f2869497daf53fd2fc946d126e515df36b7c5ab84866c13a395f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫말을―― ⟪k:1⟫꺼내진 ⟪k:2⟫못 했습니다. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫백발 소녀의 실루엣은 ⟪k:5⟫틀림없이 소녀와 똑같"
"았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a61946a213de65ecc64861b7e4e12186c0a48085b612f961e6ea4e5b8f276679
#. default-sha256: c910e18a87b59bf127ddd5b942777d494e69ff40ecce1eebb73ff6611b84840b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……아니지요, ⟪k:1⟫과연 똑같았을지요?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫방금 ⟪k:4⟫그 말은――"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9dfee31a8e3e2e770bedd848e2f0975dc4956b8783d8f3ae051ae0d4c6c4c06
#. default-sha256: cd394bebed5d81ac5d152e891e478e1557a3da4760c0379c22f8fdea2a1e6d8b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫G-⟪k:1⟫Get off me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저, ⟪k:1⟫저리 떨어져――!!"

#: scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b669836340a5c1fb393f2f1e4e2bd737733703e20b40e4d1c6fc1cb8c8868c9
#. default-sha256: d573b157740c7ffd35689a991f2add5076b2d63c0b49908a910de352c98dfdf3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He reflexively shoved the girl straddling him aside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫멜은 반사적으로 ⟪k:3⟫자기 위에 있는 백발 소녀를 밀쳤습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04d6769da51caf81f4bf79a5e951ec599c18f8e1333085f1aef37f7e0c0eea95
#. default-sha256: faf26c11ff2e34dd09b89aa188547a4988e3245a01ef8bc0a73162fff64914c3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She rolled off the bed, landing on the cold floor, ⟪k:1⟫but slowly, gradually, she crawled "
"her way back toward him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 침대에서 굴러 ⟪k:1⟫싸늘한 바닥에 내동댕이쳐졌지만, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫천천히, ⟪k:4⟫천천히 ⟪k:5⟫"
"멜에게 기어갔습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac5df42e124ddbc2bfa555d8702cabc8456ffddae1e7773c14da67327a0d5628
#. default-sha256: 2189a285e0bdf82f0fafaa5498891e43516b147666f21a45a2d0ec0e9ac1bd84
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너무하네……."

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfe71181b03f00b501589cd0d5dfe357909a5e3e76eb4d8c2af880499ad0e071
#. default-sha256: 12f39ebac79fa4f54d4b9240f9a6f1194dd7ec284a6a55b1488385ee68a1d2b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어둠 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫소녀가 천천히 고개를 들었습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그리고―― ⟪k:4⟫또다시 ⟪k:5⟫천둥."
"⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a36e0fb4dbc9bcc249da67e31f4064ec57ef30d15f4db332837c03e283a7f4b5
#. default-sha256: 9f5d8b4a726e8e3420ce9039453d18cb050faf84210d227eef08cbeaf3d5ab09
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫두꺼운 커튼이 굽이치며 ⟪k:1⟫그 틈새로 빛이 쏜살같이 들어왔습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1310774424b39022bcd003eddae77136d5cf6171d31aba37ea44fdec19cabde1
#. default-sha256: b6b489110d54f4466639a5c44bd02bb31c745aa09db07bd1156a98b62153769d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫……그 눈은 아마빛이었습니다. ⟪k:21⟫아니지요, ⟪k:22⟫희푸른 천둥을 쬐는 그 눈은 "
"⟪k:23⟫아마빛이 아닌 ⟪k:24⟫금빛과 같았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10bb2880ac1358e7f39c83aabba2fe805e703971100cbd5e8f8f5bffe6776abb
#. default-sha256: fd0693d53afcf631ed46d07a2554b9b1d62673455c96e07840d7a16f9dc0d859
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫침실에 여러 번 왔지? ⟪k:1⟫왜 매몰차게 대하고 그래. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그치……, ⟪k:4⟫멜?"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f66772be73927cfc8d144d32befac16470081bc58bef51caa992d34db6b426b1
#. default-sha256: a8451b57e241f4f40c21ddc4732ec76f146aca331e2e6952f901d5b52ac01728
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아니면…… ⟪k:1⟫키스를 다르게 했어? ⟪k:2⟫알려 주라…… 그 여자는 ⟪k:3⟫너랑 어떻게 접하고, ⟪k:4⟫어"
"떻게 앙탈을 부렸어……?"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80acd8f46f929847e421378df2a9d7b8b8206e3b47db0eb61d47ed413d42c500
#. default-sha256: 8cfefd7d6ad10a48ee0db978496d69923300c661f384f91e8a21e984943b8b92
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미……, ⟪k:1⟫미친, ⟪k:2⟫――미친 짓 그만해, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫넬리!!!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫무, ⟪k:9⟫무슨 생"
"각으로 ⟪k:10⟫이런…… 이런 짓을……!!"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97c1ec3368c8e28412f8ebda1a992c6a0a4f1d8a339ea01e96a32396092fd0f8
#. default-sha256: 4be89ab44c4c9f7c255a74e3e33fd31cd428ee014c4415f0d33a7cab11fda9fc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫멜은…… 백발을 좋아하지?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫백발이 좋아서 ⟪k:3⟫그 여자한테 반한 거지?"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 824e14233c7d7382748b90c8d03f473b825d809433ff5e76a7b2ded4a9e4eb66
#. default-sha256: 704bdd104d2c6adc2a0caac274e4b24c2414c55ee1a61e4d17d5a9b73af6eed9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아하하……, ⟪k:1⟫그럼 백발이 되면 ⟪k:2⟫넬리도 똑같잖아. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫다시 오라버니의 공주님이 될 "
"수 있어."

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1db9d3400bc9ad4ea5fd1fb96f82e401a4bb47b88bbde23a95532cbaf04fedd7
#. default-sha256: bdeb0ccc41c369409fd72b330b54d3649bd555ccd6104c4526d4b434e9c266ce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무…… 무슨, ⟪k:1⟫무슨 이상한 소릴……."

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6172f0dfd4b4bf9cd463553c0ad3b79311bd9de50b72c20d8ef4ad6ac06a598d
#. default-sha256: ab2a71bbe67c03193695baa49b5b92b0c41d002134f4457baabf101af52f5426
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜은 ⟪k:1⟫소녀―― ⟪k:2⟫넬리의 날카로운 시선에서 ⟪k:3⟫헤어나질 못 했습니다. ⟪k:4⟫왜? ⟪k:5⟫어째"
"서? ⟪k:6⟫무슨 일이 있었길래?"

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d12b4ffb4e18ac04d2b0eb016c35d7b0ec4b9e327aa3a37bcce155edb445c9f
#. default-sha256: d0f6a97a835e363f6050007da47bc24176cc87a704195a7f695108fb6050dbde
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……멜의 머릿속에선 ⟪k:1⟫의문이 폭풍처럼 몰아쳤습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33d84940c4a8a54719d2df6b9b685a3cf343191359592908c6fe0aa573e01ceb
#. default-sha256: 0f83a48065959a0535d6f9ed54a883be1e20a3c23937dd3fa965f43294d5efef
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
